File Purpose Emit/MultiArityFamilyDetect.cs Detects multi-arity families from CLR types Emit/MultiArityAliasEmit.cs Generates sentinel-ladder type aliases Emit/FamilyIndexEmitter.cs Emits families.json canonical family index FacadeFamilyIndex
